'''Tales of the Nekoluga''' (伝説のネコルガ族, ''Densetsu no Nekoruga Zoku'', '''The Legendary Nekoluga Family''') is one of the Rare Cat Capsule events in [[The Battle Cats]]. The Tales of the Nekoluga Event was added in April 27th, 2015 in [[The Battle Cats]]. The main role of the set aims for Backliner support units that can target all types, while being extremely useless in Normal Form, having extremely long range compared to most other units, and having extremely long recharge times. The newest member in the family was added in [[Version 14.2 Update|Version 14.2]], being [[Mamoluga (Uber Rare Cat)|Mamoluga]].

To unlock this banner in [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], the player has to clear [[Japan (Empire of Cats)|Japan]] in the [[Empire of Cats|Empire of Cats Chapter]].

